// Machine windows (content/skygear/machine.go): the vanilla
// small chest screen with only the machine's slots, placed per machine.
// Routed from inventoryui's chest_screen.json by the title marker §d§m§<n>.
// The vanilla window and slot pictures with the vanilla dark grey title, as
// on the furnace screen; the progress indicator slot has no background.
// Slots 24, 25 and 26 (take all, put all, info) sit in the dark control bar
// above the window's top right corner. See docs/tech/machines.md.
